id: DB-010
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Database connection created per request (connection pool missing)
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .py .java .go
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: new\s+Client\s*\(
    message: "new Client() in request handler — creates a DB connection per request. Use a connection pool."
  - regex: DriverManager\.getConnection\s*\(
    message: "DriverManager.getConnection() — creates raw JDBC connection. Use a connection pool (HikariCP, c3p0)."
  - regex: psycopg2\.connect\s*\(
    message: "psycopg2.connect() in request context — creates a new connection per call. Use a pool (psycopg2.pool or SQLAlchemy)."
  - regex: createConnection\s*\(
    message: "createConnection() — creates a single connection. Use createPool() or connection pooling."
fix: Use a connection pool. Node: createPool(). Python: SQLAlchemy/psycopg2.pool. Java: HikariCP. Go: database/sql (built-in pooling).
